            "noteHtml": "Be sure you have requested your Netflix Stranger Things license before submitting the entry form. License requests can be made\u00a0<a href=\"https://create.roblox.com/explore/licenses/6fdf2c6d-e7e9-40de-a94c-b40411675759\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">here</a>.",
