            "labelHtml": "I confirm I am a legal resident of either the 50 US/DC, Canada or Mexico and am at least 18 years of age (or age of majority in my jurisdiction of residence, whichever is older) and have read and agree to the <a href=\"/rules\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><strong>Official Rules</strong></a> and <a href=\"/termsofuse\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><strong>Contest Global Terms of Use and Privacy Policy</strong></a>.",
            "required": true,
            "errorMessage": "You must agree to continue"
