    "summaryHtml": "<strong>NO PURCHASE NECESSARY.</strong> Enter Contest between 12:01 a.m. PT on 11/6/26 and 11:59 p.m. PT on 1/8/27. Open to legal residents of the 50 U.S. &amp; D.C., Canada and Mexico who are at least 18 years of age (or age of majority in their jurisdiction of residence, whichever is older). See <a href=\"/rules\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Official Rules</a> for full details on eligibility requirements, how to enter, judging criteria, prize descriptions and limitations. Void where prohibited."
